  title: Trouble Classification
  body: "The Administration Bureau categorizes terminal services into four types: A D R U Z. A for new users, D for damage and malfunctions, R for renewal, U for upgrade, Z for uncategorized issues. And the numbers are individual serial numbers that make up the number on the receipt."
  clueId: clue_trouble_classification